unfertilized), seed=$10. All correct. The "harvest at day 2 to maximize
profit" advice is wrong (see below).
Locked quadrants cost $1k / $2k / $4k in that order (NE, SW, SE). ✅
Hire cost is fib(n) * farmHandCostMult with fib(0)=1,1,2,3,5,8,13,…
per day, resets at midnight. ✅
10 order/turn market cap, overflow silently dropped. ✅
Plants must be watered daily; 2 consecutive missed days → weed. ✅
Tile types: None, "LOCKED", plant dict (kind: PLANT), weed dict
